{"type":"text","timestamp":1794357758739,"sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","part":{"id":"prt_1c80e8b04001S7rdBEfIhJEsaA","messageID":"msg_1c80e7a1b001Azz2CIZ7e9TdRx","sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","type":"text","text":"<think>Flask is not installed system-wide. I need a venv to test the backend. The /tmp/opencode path seems allowed (\"Use /tmp/opencode for temporary work outside the workspace. This directory has already been created, already exists, and is pre-approved\"). But my command was denied by the permission system — possibly due to the pip install hitting the network (external) or because creating the venv in /tmp/opencode was seen as... hmm, it said \"The user has specified a rule which prevents you from using this specific tool call.\" with the deny rule for external_directory `*`. The allow for /tmp/opencode/* came before the deny... but the deny matched `/tmp/opencode/.venv`? It should match the /tmp/opencode/* allow first if rules are evaluated in order. Unless the *allow* pattern list order means the first matching rule wins: `{\"permission\":\"*\",\"action\":\"allow\",\"pattern\":\"*\"}` — first rule allows everything. Then why denied?\n\nMaybe the denial was for the network access in pip (pip install is not external_directory). Hmm, the error mentions external_directory rules explicitly. Possibly the venv creation writes to /tmp/opencode/.venv but pip's cache dir or the interpreter symlinks... Actually python3 -m venv creates symlinks to /usr/bin/python3 — no.\n\nLet me try creating the venv inside the workspace in a gitignored dir, e.g. /workspace/.venv. The .dockerignore ignores .venv. But it would pollute git status. I can add it to .gitignore... there's no .gitignore in the repo? Let me check. Actually .dockerignore exists but no .gitignore. I'll create the venv at /workspace/.venv and remove it at the end, or leave it (untracked). Better: create it in /tmp/opencode but with a simpler command to see if the path is theissue.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794357758724,"end":1794357758736}}}
