{"type":"text","timestamp":1794357821852,"sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","part":{"id":"prt_1c80f8184001MzhdX8gR69inqG","messageID":"msg_1c80f77f4001o1PiAKbcDnRBhG","sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","type":"text","text":"<think>All backend tests pass. Now let me set up the frontend with Tailwind.\n\nSteps:\n1. `npm install -D tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite` in frontend/ (updates package-lock.json).\n2. vite.config.ts: add the tailwindcss plugin.\n3. src/index.css: `@import \"tailwindcss\";`\n4. main.tsx: import \"./index.css\".\n\nLet me also check the vite version (8.3.5) compatibility with @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5. Tailwind v4's vite plugin supports Vite 5/6/7... Let me check peer deps for vite 8. Let me look at the npm view output for @tailwindcss/vite peerDependencies.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794357821828,"end":1794357821848}}}
