{"type":"text","timestamp":1794358110355,"sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","part":{"id":"prt_1c813e881001Q7SiVP82QBxaf8","messageID":"msg_1c813da1b001t0mr7Rbe0kHJ8C","sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","type":"text","text":"<think>The playwright driver can't run because libatomic.so.1 is missing. Can I install it? `apt-get install libatomic1` requires network access to the apt repo (probably blocked) and root. Let me check if I'm root and if apt works.\n\nLet me try: `sudo apt-get install -y libatomic1` — the sandbox has no other network access, but maybe the apt cache is available. Let me tryquickly.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794358110337,"end":1794358110351}}}
