{"type":"text","timestamp":1794358119325,"sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","part":{"id":"prt_1c8140b74001wKQv3MV8rcrMGH","messageID":"msg_1c813f83e001byIXh82reG85u1","sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","type":"text","text":"<think>libatomic isn't available. The playwright node driver won't run without it. \n\nOptions: \n1. Skip browser testing; rely on careful reasoning + API tests.\n2. Try to find libatomic in some npm package (e.g., `@playwright/browser-chromium` might bundle some libs? Unlikely).\n\nLet me check if there's a pip package that provides libatomic... `pip download` of some wheel containing libatomic.so.1? There's a conda-style package... Not worth it.\n\nHmm, actually — maybe I can check if the playwright browser download itself worked (the chromium binary download comes from the CDN; the driver error occurred before the download). The error was from running the node driver, so the browser wasn't downloaded. Let me check whether the browser download is even possible: `playwright install chromium` failed at the driver step, so we don't know.\n\nLet me test if the CDN is reachable with curl. If it is, maybe I can find libatomic elsewhere... Without root, I can extract a .deb to a directory and set LD_LIBRARY_PATH. `apt-get download libatomic1` requires network to the Debian mirror. Let me test if that's reachable.\n\nLet me try: `cd /tmp && apt-get download libatomic1` (no root needed for download, but the lock issue was for install). Let me test the network todeb.debian.org first.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794358119284,"end":1794358119310}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794358119450,"sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c8140889706b9357287f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && timeout 60 curl -sSI https://deb.debian.org/debian/ 2>&1 | head -3; timeout 60 curl -sSI https://cdn.playwright.dev/ 2>&1 | head -3","timeout":150000},"output":"curl: (56) CONNECT tunnel failed, response 403\nHTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\r\nServer: llm-gateway Python/3.12.12\r\ncurl: (56) CONNECT tunnel failed, response 403\nHTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\r\nServer: llm-gateway Python/3.12.12\r\n","metadata":{"output":"curl: (56) CONNECT tunnel failed, response 403\nHTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\r\nServer: llm-gateway Python/3.12.12\r\ncurl: (56) CONNECT tunnel failed, response 403\nHTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\r\nServer: llm-gateway Python/3.12.12\r\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && timeout 60 curl -sSI https://deb.debian.org/debian/ 2>&1 | head -3; timeout 60 curl -sSI https://cdn.playwright.dev/ 2>&1 | head -3","time":{"start":1794358119297,"end":1794358119430}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c8140b79001lkuE65Yq00M7UQ","sessionID":"ses_e37f28d7bffekBPOL1DKCH4OOV","messageID":"msg_1c813f83e001byIXh82reG85u1"}}
